WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:04.258
Roxy arrived downtown.

2
00:00:04.259 --> 00:00:10.015
Everywhere she looked, she saw people trapped in nets.

3
00:00:10.016 --> 00:00:16.408
Crime Fighter Bot was moving along the sidewalk, shooting out more nets.

4
00:00:16.409 --> 00:00:22.508
Whiz-hoo! Roxy used her eye laser beams to slice through the nets.

5
00:00:22.509 --> 00:00:27.310
"Rocket Girl!" Dr. Odd was still trapped. "Over here!"

6
00:00:27.311 --> 00:00:31.567
Roxy flew over and freed Dr. Odd and Bippo.

7
00:00:31.568 --> 00:00:34.441
"What happened?" Roxy asked.

8
00:00:34.442 --> 00:00:38.906
"I was about to turn off Crime Fighter Bot for good," Dr. Odd said.

9
00:00:38.907 --> 00:00:41.445
"But it ignored my commands!"

10
00:00:41.446 --> 00:00:46.082
Roxy frowned. "It's time to take down that robot!"

11
00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:48.715
"We need to pull out its energy core.

12
00:00:48.716 --> 00:00:52.193
It's under its chest plate," Dr. Odd said.

13
00:00:52.194 --> 00:00:55.012
"Let's go!" Roxy said.

14
00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:59.261
Down the block, people were running from Crime Fighter Bot.

15
00:00:59.262 --> 00:01:04.826
"The law is the law," the robot said. "You are breaking the law!"

16
00:01:04.827 --> 00:01:08.301
Zip! It shot a net at a hot dog stand.

17
00:01:08.302 --> 00:01:12.039
"My hot dogs!" the hot dog man cried.

18
00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:15.491
"They never hurt anyone!"

19
00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:20.134
The robot spun around and saw Roxy, Dr. Odd, and Bippo.

20
00:01:20.135 --> 00:01:22.784
Zip! It shot a net at them.

21
00:01:22.785 --> 00:01:26.433
Roxy quickly melted it with her heat vision.

22
00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:28.768
The robot tried to shoot another net.

23
00:01:28.769 --> 00:01:30.468
But it was out of them.

24
00:01:30.469 --> 00:01:33.111
Then Roxy noticed something on the sidewalk.

25
00:01:33.112 --> 00:01:34.701
It was a mailbox.

26
00:01:34.702 --> 00:01:38.405
"Hmm. I have an idea!" Roxy

27
00:01:38.406 --> 00:01:41.458
planted herself in front of the mailbox. "Hey,

28
00:01:41.459 --> 00:01:44.498
metal head!" she yelled at the robot. "Arrest

29
00:01:44.499 --> 00:01:47.754
me—if you can!" The

30
00:01:47.755 --> 00:01:54.177
robot made an angry sound and charged at Roxy. She

31
00:01:54.178 --> 00:01:56.657
jumped out of the way. Bam! The

32
00:01:56.658 --> 00:01:59.518
robot slammed hard into the mailbox. Mail

33
00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:01.982
went flying everywhere. "Uh-oh!"

34
00:02:01.983 --> 00:02:04.565
Roxy said loudly. "Messing

35
00:02:04.566 --> 00:02:06.906
with the mail is a crime. You

36
00:02:06.907 --> 00:02:11.794
broke the law! And the law is the law!" "No!"

37
00:02:11.795 --> 00:02:15.170
Sparks flew from the robot's head. "Crime

38
00:02:15.171 --> 00:02:17.682
Fighter Bot follows the law!" The

39
00:02:17.683 --> 00:02:20.624
robot reached out, grabbing Roxy. "Ahh!

40
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:24.428
Let go of me!" Roxy cried. Bippo

41
00:02:24.429 --> 00:02:26.745
jumped onto the robot's shoulder. It

42
00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.381
ran in circles around the robot's head. The

43
00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:31.611
robot's head spun wildly. "Grr!"

44
00:02:31.612 --> 00:02:36.391
Roxy broke free and punched the robot in the chest. Its

45
00:02:36.392 --> 00:02:38.358
chest plate fell off. Then

46
00:02:38.359 --> 00:02:41.415
Roxy yanked out its power core. The

47
00:02:41.416 --> 00:02:47.179
robot's eye went black. "Hero,

48
00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:50.541
you!" Bippo said. Roxy

49
00:02:50.542 --> 00:02:55.117
grinned. "Heroes, us!" ***

50
00:02:55.118 --> 00:02:58.005
Back at school, lunch recess was almost over.

51
00:02:58.006 --> 00:03:01.869
"Hey, Roxy!" Mara said. "Did you hear?"

52
00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.196
Jack hung upside down from the jungle gym.

53
00:03:04.197 --> 00:03:07.630
"Crime Fighter Bot went crazy!"

54
00:03:07.631 --> 00:03:09.467
Terrell winked at Roxy.

55
00:03:09.468 --> 00:03:13.688
"It's a good thing Metro City still has Rocket Girl!"

56
00:03:13.689 --> 00:03:19.930
Roxy grinned. "I totally agree!"

